    <string name="section_built_in_lists">Built-in Lists</string>
    <string name="built_in_lists_footer">Turning a list off stops using it right away. HaGeZi Pro also blocks many ads the other lists miss, plus trackers and scams. Pro++ blocks even more but is more likely to break a site or app; if something stops working, allow it in \"Block &amp; Allow Domains\" or turn Pro++ off.</string>
    <string name="section_custom_lists">Your Lists</string>
    <string name="custom_lists_footer">Add a list in hosts, domain, *.domain or Adblock (||domain^) format by its https URL. It is downloaded with the other lists once a day. Tap a list to remove it.</string>
