    <string name="log_delete_older">Log entries older than %1$s will be deleted. This can\'t be undone.</string>
    <string name="row_capture_dns">Block Apps\' Own DNS</string>
    <string name="capture_dns_footer">Some apps send lookups straight to public DNS servers (such as 8.8.8.8 or 1.1.1.1), which gets around ad blocking. When this is on, those lookups are filtered too, and encrypted lookups to these servers (DNS over HTTPS / TLS) are refused so that apps fall back to the phone\'s DNS. While it\'s on, you can\'t ping these addresses.</string>
